==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|крича́ть|-ун}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|крику́н}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|b|крику́н|a=an|f=крику́нья,крику́шка,крику́ха}}

# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} [[bawler]]; [[shouter]]; [[screamer]], [[crier]]  {{gl|someone who shouts or likes to shout, screams, yells or cries}}
# [[loudmouth]]; [[clamourer|clamo(u)rer]]; [[squaller]] {{gl|one who talks too much or too loudly, especially in a boastful or self-important manner, someone who makes noise}}
# {{lb|ru|derogatory|political}} [[propagandist]]; someone spreading negative and sometimes false information

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|b|крику́н|a=an}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|крик|g=m}}
* {{l|ru|крикли́вый}}
* {{l|ru|крича́ть|g=impf}}, {{l|ru|кри́кнуть|g=pf}}

